# Flowerfoot Swordmaster's valiant: the first time each turn it becomes the target of a spell or ability its controller controls, Mice its controller controls get
# +1/+0 until end of turn (CR 611.2c, 205.3). Turn 3: Giant Growth on the Swordmaster (5/5 with the trigger) also pumps Bot1's Brave-Kin Duo (a Rabbit Mouse, 2/1) but not Bot1's
# Savannah Lions (a Cat, still 2/1 from its own power) nor Bot2's Brave-Kin Duo (1/1). The Duo's own ability targets the Swordmaster a second time the same turn:
# +1/+1 only, no second +1/+0 to the Mice.

